    "why": [
      "Saves 25% irrigation water (248 mm/yr \u2014 ~3 flood irrigations and 137 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 4.2 cm/yr.",
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 86/100 (+67 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by +1.9 t C/ha, saving 3.6 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 26-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 100 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 10.8 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9240,147/ha (\u20b997,184/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b9201,057/ha (\u20b981,365/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: PM-PRANAM Alternative Fertiliser & Bio-N Incentive; NFSM-Pulses & NAFED e-Samridhi Assured MSP Procurement."
